+/* Based on:
+ *  o RFC 8391 - XMSS: eXtended Merkle Signature Scheme
+ *  o [HDSS] "Hash-based Digital Signature Schemes", Buchmann, Dahmen and Szydlo
+ *    from "Post Quantum Cryptography", Springer 2009.
